## portus — framework HTTP para PenguScript.
##
## Un servidor HTTP/1.1 completo sobre `poll(2)` y llhttp, con la API de un
## framework de rutas: `Application`, `Context`, `Handler` y un `HttpError` como
## valor. Sin closures: los handlers son `weave`s con nombre.
##
## ## Ejemplo
## ```pengu
## import std.spark
## import portus
##
## weave hello with context as ref to portus.Context into result of void to portus.HttpError:
##     calling context.send_text with "hola"
##     return calling portus.ok_void
##
## weave main into int:
##     var app as portus.Application is calling portus.new_application
##     let added as result of void to portus.route.PatternError is calling portus.get with sigil of app, "/", hello
##     let served as result of int to string is calling portus.serve with sigil of app, 3000
##     return 0
## ```
##
## ## Memoria
## `Application` es dueña de sus rutas: libérala con `portus.application.free_application`.
## El servidor presta la aplicación mientras corre.
import portus.application as application_module
import portus.context as context_module
import portus.group as group_module
import portus.error
import portus.handler as handler_module
import portus.route as route_module
import portus.transport as transport

alias Application as application_module.Application
alias Context as context_module.Context
alias Handler as handler_module.Handler
alias Params as route_module.Params
alias PatternError as route_module.PatternError
alias Request as transport.Request
alias Response as transport.Response
alias ServeOptions as transport.ServeOptions
alias HttpError as error.HttpError
alias ErrorHandler as handler_module.ErrorHandler
alias Middleware as handler_module.Middleware
alias MiddlewareFn as handler_module.MiddlewareFn
alias AppHook as application_module.AppHook
alias Group as group_module.Group

## Versión del paquete.
const PORTUS_VERSION as string is "0.1.0"

## Crea una aplicación vacía.
weave new_application into Application:
    return calling application_module.new_application

## Opciones de arranque por defecto (`127.0.0.1:3000`).
weave default_options into ServeOptions:
    return calling transport.base_options

## `result of void to HttpError` con éxito.
weave ok_void into result of void to HttpError:
    return calling handler_module.ok_void

## `result of void to HttpError` con fallo.
weave err_void with failure as HttpError into result of void to HttpError:
    return calling handler_module.err_void with failure

## Registra una ruta `GET`.
weave get with app as ref to Application, pattern as string, handler as Handler into result of void to PatternError:
    return calling application_module.add with app, "GET", pattern, handler

## Registra una ruta `POST`.
weave post with app as ref to Application, pattern as string, handler as Handler into result of void to PatternError:
    return calling application_module.add with app, "POST", pattern, handler

## Registra una ruta `PUT`.
weave put with app as ref to Application, pattern as string, handler as Handler into result of void to PatternError:
    return calling application_module.add with app, "PUT", pattern, handler

## Registra una ruta `PATCH`.
weave patch with app as ref to Application, pattern as string, handler as Handler into result of void to PatternError:
    return calling application_module.add with app, "PATCH", pattern, handler

## Registra una ruta `DELETE`.
weave delete with app as ref to Application, pattern as string, handler as Handler into result of void to PatternError:
    return calling application_module.add with app, "DELETE", pattern, handler

## Registra una ruta `HEAD`.
weave head with app as ref to Application, pattern as string, handler as Handler into result of void to PatternError:
    return calling application_module.add with app, "HEAD", pattern, handler

## Registra una ruta para cualquier método.
weave any with app as ref to Application, pattern as string, handler as Handler into result of void to PatternError:
    return calling application_module.add with app, "*", pattern, handler

## Arranca el servidor en `port` y bloquea. Devuelve el puerto real.
##
## ## Memoria
## La aplicación debe vivir mientras el servidor corre.
weave serve with app as ref to Application, port as int into result of int to string:
    var options as ServeOptions is calling transport.base_options
    set options.port is port
    return calling application_module.serve_with with app, options

## Crea un grupo de rutas bajo `prefix` (`"/api"`).
##
## ## Memoria
## El `Group` presta la aplicación: no la libera ni la copia.
weave new_group with app as ref to Application, prefix as string into Group:
    return calling group_module.group_with_prefix with app, prefix

## Envuelve una función de middleware en un `Middleware` con su `data`.
weave middleware with invoke as MiddlewareFn into Middleware:
    return calling handler_module.middleware with invoke

## Añade un middleware para todas las rutas.
weave use with app as ref to Application, layer as Middleware into void:
    return calling application_module.use with app, layer

## Añade un middleware solo bajo `prefix`.
weave use_at with app as ref to Application, prefix as string, layer as Middleware into void:
    return calling application_module.use_at with app, prefix, layer

## Añade un middleware que corre después de la ruta.
weave after with app as ref to Application, layer as Middleware into void:
    return calling application_module.after with app, layer

## Registra el manejador de errores de la aplicación.
weave on_error with app as ref to Application, handler as ErrorHandler into void:
    return calling application_module.on_error with app, handler

## Registra el manejador de rutas no encontradas.
weave on_not_found with app as ref to Application, handler as Handler into void:
    return calling application_module.on_not_found with app, handler

## Registra un hook que corre al arrancar.
weave on_start with app as ref to Application, hook as AppHook into void:
    return calling application_module.on_start with app, hook

## Registra un hook que corre al apagar.
weave on_shutdown with app as ref to Application, hook as AppHook into void:
    return calling application_module.on_shutdown with app, hook

## Crea un `HttpError` 400.
weave bad_request with message as string into HttpError:
    return calling error.bad_request with message

## Crea un `HttpError` 404.
weave not_found into HttpError:
    return calling error.not_found

## Crea un `HttpError` 500.
weave internal_error into HttpError:
    return calling error.internal

## Ping del binding nativo (humo de instalación).
weave ping with n as int into int:
    return calling transport.native_ping with n
